B.afW=new A.fv("1. Who we are","Tactivo is a football session-planning app operated by Tactivo Limited, company number 17373279, registered in England & Wales at 63 Carlton Road, Erith, DA8 1DX, United Kingdom. Contact us at info@tactivo.co.uk. By using Tactivo you agree to these terms.")
B.ag9=new A.fv("2. Who can use it","You must be at least 16 to create an account. Tactivo is built for coaches, not for players: do not use it to store information about children or any other person.")
